---
import { influences } from '../data/influences';
---

<section class="section" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">01 — About</p>
    <h2 class="section-title" id="about-heading">About me</h2>

    <p class="about__lead">
      I feel that my influences in my life have truly formed what is known as
      “me”. Through my life up to this point, I have had four great influences
      which have lead me towards where I am now. Hockey, band, computers, and my
      parents all created a personality for myself which plays a large role in
      my every day decisions.
    </p>

    <div class="channels">
      {
        influences.map((track, i) => (
          <article class="channel reveal" style={`--channel-color: ${track.color}; --reveal-delay: ${i * 80}ms;`}>
            <header class="channel__head">
              <span class="channel__swatch" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="channel__num">{track.number}</span>
              <h3 class="channel__name">{track.label}</h3>
            </header>
            <div class="channel__body">
              {track.paragraphs.map((p) => (
                <p>{p}</p>
              ))}
            </div>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <p class="about__close reveal">
      So who am I? I am a young professional with an ambitious attitude. I am a
      graduate of Drake University, with a double major in information systems
      and marketing, and a minor in computer science. I have worked as a
      warehouse worker and as a data collector at MacLean Power Systems, a
      student helper at the Drake support center, a systems administrator
      assistant in the CBPA at Drake, and as an application developer at
      Principal Financial Group. I constantly am pushing myself to further my
      education and to gain knowledge and skills. I am a dedicated, hard worker.
      I am a great friend. I am Alan Kay.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
